	(footprint "PRT1_Tabs"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "b2839666-67e0-4336-87ee-15fd8076d544")
		(at 57.182546 79.625)
		(descr "Three lands on FLEX2 for the three output tabs of the cell's protection circuit PRT1 (custom part; its interface is fixed by design/ecad/band/band-interface.md section 5, not by a maker sheet). Pad 1 'P+' = cell positive output (net VBAT, ring pin BT1 P1), pad 3 'NTC' = temperature sensor RT1 pin 1 (net NTC), pad 2 'P-' = cell negative output and RT1 pin 2 (net GND, ring pins BT1 P2 and RT1 2). Lands 0.26 along the tail x 0.45 across, pitch 0.43 along the tail in the order 1, 3, 2 (pad 2 farthest from the slot). The PRT1 tabs are nickel strips 0.30 wide x 0.10 thick lying on the lands; solder by hand.")
